# pkg-systemd-robustify-argument-quoting.patch is deliberately NOT applied:
# this branch ships prebuilt dist/ bundles and does not rebuild them during
# package build. Applying a patch under pkg/ makes that source newer than the
# committed dist/ stamp (dist/static/manifest.json), which makes the Makefile
# attempt a full bundle rebuild that fails for lack of node_modules. The patch
# is kept only to document the source change; the fix reaches the shipped
# bundle via direct bundle seddery in debian/rules.
